      {
        "position": 1,
        "title": "Gentle and handy for washing our kitty",
        "text": "I got this brush to help clean our kitty who has a stubborn case of stud tail around her lower back and the base of her tail. It’s been great for gently working through that area without irritating her skin. In case you were wondering, the silicone bristles on this brush don’t move on their own. You create the massaging effect by rubbing the brush over your pet as you wash them which actually works really well. I love that it’s rechargeable too so there’s no faffing about with batteries. The built-in shampoo dispenser is a nice touch, but I’d avoid using thick shampoos as they can clog it. Mixing the shampoo with a bit of water beforehand helps it foam up better and keeps things running smoothly. The brush itself feels durable enough to handle my kitty and the silicone handle has a good grip, even when wet. It doesn’t hold loads of shampoo and water but it’s perfect for quick washes and it’s better suited for smaller pets. The brush does feel a little expensive but overall, it’s made bath time much easier and more comfortable for both of us.",
        "rating": 4,
        "date": "June 26, 2025",
        "author": "Amazon Customer",
        "author_link": "https://www.amazon.com/gp/profile/amzn1.account.AHUVITRIF5P35C7WIA35IMAYBGVA?ref=cm_cr_dp_d_bdcrb_top",
        "author_image": "https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/amazon-avatars-global/default._SX48_.png",
